    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Understood. Then make the note specific so it's useful later:\n\n> *Splits.* The current train/test split is random at the window level. Because a student contributes many windows, this split may allow student-level information to appear in both train and test. We will release a student-grouped split and report results on it.\n\nAnd put a TODO in your tracker with the date, so it actually happens before reviews come back."
     ]
